<rml>
<head>
	<!--
		The settings screen (ADR-0018 §3): the menu's Impostazioni. What it changes goes to <user data>/settings.json, over
		the hand-written files of <user data>/config, which stay untouched. Applied at once, the file written when it
		closes; "Ripristina" lets the layer below show through.
		Bound to the data model "settings" of rv::ui::SettingsScreen (src/ui/src/settings_screen.cpp), which also names the
		ids below (src/ui/include/rv/ui/settings_model.hpp). group: display, audio, world, controls, vr. A row: key
		(app::SettingRow::id(), section and dotted key), kind (toggle, choice, slider), value (a toggle's on or off, a
		choice's value as text), text (a slider's number), fill (its bar), scene (the FOV's null), note ('', commit, session,
		start), overridden; a binding row (I7 step 3, ADR-0018 §7): keyLabel, padLabel (names from key_labels.json), heading
		(world, ui: the list it opens). capture: '', waiting, offer; captureKey, captureOther (rows), captureRefused
		(reserved, locked), captureSeconds. The hints come from the active bindings (ui/hint_bar.hpp): a hint-action names
		the actions, the verb stays here. Every string is written here (CLAUDE.md): the screen binds keys and numbers only. The focus is the
		model's; the input stays with the application; a click presses what a key would (VR's ray too). The bundled fonts
		have no symbols: the arrows are plain text.
	-->
	<title>Impostazioni</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="settings.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="hint_bar.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="settings">
	<div id="settings-panel" class="panel">
		<h1>Impostazioni</h1>
		<div id="st-tabs">
			<button class="tab" data-class-active="group == 'display'" data-event-click="tab('display')">Schermo</button>
			<button class="tab" data-class-active="group == 'audio'" data-event-click="tab('audio')">Audio</button>
			<button class="tab" data-class-active="group == 'world'" data-event-click="tab('world')">Mondo</button>
			<button class="tab" data-class-active="group == 'controls'" data-event-click="tab('controls')">Controlli</button>
			<button class="tab" data-class-active="group == 'vr'" data-event-click="tab('vr')">VR</button>
		</div>
		<div id="st-list">
			<div class="slot" data-for="row : rows">
				<div class="list-title" data-if="row.heading != ''">
					<span class="title-text" data-if="row.heading == 'world'">Nel mondo</span>
					<span class="title-text" data-if="row.heading == 'ui'">Nei menu</span>
					<span class="title-device">Tastiera</span>
					<span class="title-device">Controller</span>
				</div>
				<div class="row" data-attr-id="row.elementId">
					<div class="label" data-event-click="row(row.index)">
						<!-- Schermo -->
						<p data-if="row.key == 'player.displayMode'">Visualizzazione</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'player.textScale'">Dimensione del testo</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'player.horizontalFovDeg'">Campo visivo</p>
						<!-- Audio -->
						<p data-if="row.key == 'video.audio.master'">Volume generale</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'video.audio.video'">Volume dei video</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'video.audio.muted'">Muto</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'video.audio.mode'">Suono</p>
						<!-- Mondo -->
						<p data-if="row.key == 'world.lightingProfile'">Illuminazione</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'world.reduceMotion'">Riduci i movimenti</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'video.enabled'">Video sugli schermi</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'video.crtEffect'">Effetto CRT</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'video.hero.playlist'">Programma dei televisori</p>
						<!-- Controlli -->
						<p data-if="row.key == 'player.mouseSensitivity'">Sensibilità del mouse</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'player.stickSensitivity'">Sensibilità della levetta</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'player.invertY'">Inverti lo sguardo verticale</p>
						<!-- Controlli: the bindings -->
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.interact'">Interagisci</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.back'">Indietro</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.quick_catalog'">Catalogo rapido</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.map'">Indice</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.menu'">Menu</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.confirm'">Conferma</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.sprint'">Corri</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.toggle_mute'">Muto</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.edit_pin'">Modifica: fissa</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.edit_rotate_left'">Modifica: ruota a sinistra</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.edit_rotate_right'">Modifica: ruota a destra</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_activate'">Conferma</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_back'">Indietro</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_media'">Vedi media</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_info'">Informazioni</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_filter_previous'">Elenco precedente</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_filter_next'">Elenco successivo</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_page_up'">Pagina su</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_page_down'">Pagina giù</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_home'">Primo elemento</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.ui_end'">Ultimo elemento</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'bindings.defaults'">Ripristina predefiniti</p>
						<!-- VR -->
						<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.display.mode'">Avvia nel visore</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.comfort.turn'">Rotazione</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.comfort.vignette'">Vignettatura</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.comfort.moveRelativeTo'">Cammina verso</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.posture'">Posizione</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.quality'">Qualità</p>
						<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.refreshRate'">Frequenza</p>
						<p class="row-note" data-if="row.note == 'commit'">Il piano si ricarica</p>
						<p class="row-note" data-if="row.note == 'session'">Alla prossima sessione VR</p>
						<p class="row-note" data-if="row.note == 'start'">Al prossimo avvio</p>
					</div>
					<div class="control" data-if="row.kind == 'binding'" data-event-click="row(row.index)">
						<div class="bind-cell"><p data-if="row.keyLabel != ''">{{ row.keyLabel }}</p><p data-if="row.keyLabel == ''">-</p></div>
						<div class="bind-cell"><p data-if="row.padLabel != ''">{{ row.padLabel }}</p><p data-if="row.padLabel == ''">-</p></div>
					</div>
					<div class="control" data-if="row.kind == 'action'" data-event-click="row(row.index)">
						<div class="value"><p data-if="!confirmAction">Torna ai tasti dei file</p><p data-if="confirmAction">Premi di nuovo</p></div>
					</div>
					<div class="control" data-if="row.kind != 'binding' && row.kind != 'action'">
						<button class="arrow" data-if="row.kind != 'toggle'" data-event-click="step(row.index, -1)">&lt;</button>
						<div class="value" data-event-click="row(row.index)">
							<!-- A slider: its bar and its number. -->
							<div class="bar" data-if="row.kind == 'slider' && !row.scene"><div class="fill" data-style-width="row.fill"></div></div>
							<p data-if="row.kind == 'slider' && row.scene">Della scena</p>
							<p data-if="row.kind == 'slider' && row.key == 'player.horizontalFovDeg' && !row.scene">{{ row.text }}°</p>
							<p data-if="row.kind == 'slider' && (row.key == 'player.mouseSensitivity' || row.key == 'player.stickSensitivity')">{{ row.text }}</p>
							<p data-if="row.kind == 'slider' && (row.key == 'video.audio.master' || row.key == 'video.audio.video' || row.key == 'xr.comfort.vignette')">{{ row.text }}%</p>
							<!-- A toggle. -->
							<p data-if="row.kind == 'toggle' && row.value == 'on'">Sì</p>
							<p data-if="row.kind == 'toggle' && row.value == 'off'">No</p>
							<!-- Choices. -->
							<p data-if="row.key == 'player.displayMode' && row.value == 'window'">In una finestra</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'player.displayMode' && row.value == 'borderless'">Schermo intero</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'player.textScale' && row.value == '1'">100%</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'player.textScale' && row.value == '1.25'">125%</p>
							<!-- A hand-written scale the row does not list. -->
							<p data-if="row.key == 'player.textScale' && row.value != '1' && row.value != '1.25'">{{ row.value }}x</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.audio.mode' && row.value == 'nearest-focused'">Acceso</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.audio.mode' && row.value == 'off'">Spento</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'world.lightingProfile' && row.value == 'evening'">Sera</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'world.lightingProfile' && row.value == 'afternoon'">Pomeriggio</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.crtEffect' && row.value == 'off'">Spento</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.crtEffect' && row.value == 'light'">Leggero</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.crtEffect' && row.value == 'vintage'">Vintage</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.hero.playlist' && row.value == 'shuffle'">Casuale</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.hero.playlist' && row.value == 'sequential'">In ordine</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.hero.playlist' && row.value == 'favorites'">Preferiti</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.hero.playlist' && row.value == 'recent'">Recenti</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'video.hero.playlist' && row.value == 'explicit'">Personalizzato</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.display.mode' && row.value == 'desktop'">No</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.display.mode' && row.value == 'vr'">Sì</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.comfort.turn' && row.value == 'snap'">A scatti</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.comfort.turn' && row.value == 'smooth'">Continua</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.comfort.moveRelativeTo' && row.value == 'head'">Dove guardi</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.comfort.moveRelativeTo' && row.value == 'hand'">Dove punta la mano</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.posture' && row.value == 'standing'">In piedi</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.posture' && row.value == 'seated'">Seduto</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.quality' && row.value == 'auto'">Automatica</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.quality' && row.value == 'full'">Piena</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.quality' && row.value == 'fast'">Veloce</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.refreshRate' && row.value == '0'">Del visore</p>
							<p data-if="row.key == 'xr.refreshRate' && row.value != '0'">{{ row.value }} Hz</p>
						</div>
						<button class="arrow" data-if="row.kind != 'toggle'" data-event-click="step(row.index, 1)">&gt;</button>
					</div>
					<button class="restore" data-class-off="!row.overridden" data-event-click="restore(row.index)">Ripristina</button>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div id="st-restore-all" class="row all" data-event-click="restore_all()">
				<p data-if="!confirmAll">Ripristina tutto</p>
				<p data-if="confirmAll">Premi di nuovo per tornare ai valori dei file di configurazione</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<!-- A capture: any key or pad button; the mouse clicks Annulla (VR's ray too). A clash: the swap, or nothing. -->
		<div id="st-capture" data-if="capture != ''">
			<div data-if="capture == 'waiting'">
				<p>Premi un tasto o un pulsante ({{ captureSeconds }} s)</p>
				<p class="capture-note" data-if="captureRefused == 'reserved'">Quel comando è riservato: premine un altro.</p>
				<p class="capture-note" data-if="captureRefused == 'locked'">Quel comando non può restare senza tasto: premine un altro.</p>
				<div class="capture-buttons">
					<button class="capture-button" data-event-click="capture_cancel()">Annulla</button>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div data-if="capture == 'offer'">
				<p>Già usato da un altro comando: scambiare i due?</p>
				<div class="capture-buttons">
					<button id="st-swap" class="capture-button" data-event-click="capture_swap()"><span class="kbd" hint-action="ui_activate"></span>Scambia</button>
					<button id="st-keep" class="capture-button" data-event-click="capture_cancel()"><span class="kbd" hint-action="ui_back"></span>Annulla</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div id="st-hints" data-if="capture == ''">
			<span class="hint"><span class="kbd" hint-action="ui_filter_previous ui_filter_next"></span>Gruppo</span>
			<span class="hint"><span class="kbd" hint-action="ui_activate"></span>Cambia</span>
			<span class="hint"><span class="kbd" hint-action="ui_info"></span>Ripristina</span>
			<span class="hint"><span class="kbd" hint-action="ui_back"></span>Indietro</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
